      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُشْغُولَةٌ</span></b>  an instance of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُفْعُولَةٌ</span> from
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشُّغْلُ</span> [similar to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُلْهُوَّةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُلْهِيَّةٌ</span>, and to <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُلْعُوبَةٌ</span>,
&amp;c.; app. meaning <i>A thing with which one is
busied,</i> &amp;c.: and also <i>syn. with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شُغْلٌ</span>]. (O, K.)

